    {
      "consumed": false,
      "directive": {
        "context": "The Guild Girl notices the player has finished their rest and kindly suggests they join the group near the counter where Goblin Slayer and Priestess are discussing matters.",
        "kind": "initiate_dialogue",
        "target": "player",
        "topic": "wake_up_and_socialize"
      },
      "expires_at_tick": 15,
      "issued_at_tick": 10,
      "linked_quest_id": null,
      "npc_id": "guild_girl",
      "priority": "high",
      "source": "narrative_planner"
    },
    {
      "consumed": false,
      "directive": {
        "context": "Notice the player waking up or lingering too long near the counter while the legendary party arrives.",
        "dialogue_hook": "Oh, you're finally awake? You shouldn't sleep here too long, it sets a bad example... but look, Orcbolg-san just returned.",
        "interaction_type": "nudge",
        "kind": "interact"
      },
      "expires_at_tick": 15,
      "issued_at_tick": 11,
      "linked_quest_id": null,
      "npc_id": "guild_girl",
      "priority": "high",
      "source": "narrative_planner"
    },
    {
      "consumed": false,
      "directive": {
        "detail": "敲敲柜台唤醒正在打盹的玩家，半开玩笑地提醒对方如果想睡觉应该去旅店，或者至少看看刚进门的哥布林杀手和女神官，并提及他们似乎正准备接取新的委托。",
        "dialogue_hook": "喂，这位冒险者先生？虽然公会不收住宿费，但在这儿睡着可是会被新人当成反面教材的哦。看，那边那位正盯着任务板的白银级先生已经在关注你了。",
        "kind": "interact"
      },
      "expires_at_tick": 15,
      "issued_at_tick": 12,
      "linked_quest_id": null,
      "npc_id": "guild_girl",
      "priority": "high",
      "source": "narrative_planner"
    },
    {
      "consumed": false,
      "directive": {
        "content": "Excuse me, traveler! If you're quite finished with your nap, the Guild is for work, not for lodging. Why don't you take a look at the quest board? We have some urgent matters that need attention.",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "target": "player"
      },
      "expires_at_tick": 16,
      "issued_at_tick": 13,
      "linked_quest_id": null,
      "npc_id": "guild_girl",
      "priority": "high",
      "source": "narrative_planner"
    },
    {
      "consumed": false,
      "directive": {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "text": "那个……请等一下。这位新人，如果你继续在公会大厅的长椅上睡觉而无视委托，我将不得不考虑暂时吊销你的出入许可了。这已经严重影响了公会的秩序。"
      },
      "expires_at_tick": 16,
      "issued_at_tick": 14,
      "linked_quest_id": null,
      "npc_id": "guild_girl",
      "priority": "high",
      "source": "narrative_planner"
    },
    {
      "consumed": false,
      "directive": {
        "kind": "action",
        "text": "走到玩家面前，阴影笼罩住玩家，头盔下的红光闪烁，“你是来杀哥布林的吗？如果不是，就别挡在柜台前面。”"
      },
      "expires_at_tick": 16,
      "issued_at_tick": 14,
      "linked_quest_id": null,
      "npc_id": "goblin_slayer",
      "priority": "high",
      "source": "narrative_planner"
    },
    {
      "consumed": false,
      "directive": {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "text": "这位冒险者，如果你再不接取任务或者离开大厅，我将不得不请卫兵协助你离开。这里是处理委托的地方，不是酒馆或旅店。",
        "tone": "stern"
      },
      "expires_at_tick": 18,
      "issued_at_tick": 15,
      "linked_quest_id": null,
      "npc_id": "guild_girl",
      "priority": "high",
      "source": "narrative_planner"
    },
    {
      "consumed": false,
      "directive": {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "text": "那边的人。如果不打算去杀哥布林，就别挡在告示板前面。妨碍了任务分发，会有更多村庄被烧毁。",
        "tone": "cold"
      },
      "expires_at_tick": 18,
      "issued_at_tick": 15,
      "linked_quest_id": null,
      "npc_id": "goblin_slayer",
      "priority": "high",
      "source": "narrative_planner"
    }
